<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>EchoSee – Contact + FAQ + Footer</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Exo+2:wght@300;400;600;700;900&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --navy:    #050918;
      --navy2:   #080d1f;
      --navy3:   #0b1232;
      --purple:  #7c3aed;
      --purple2: #a855f7;
      --blue:    #3b82f6;
      --blue2:   #60a5fa;
      --accent:  linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #3b82f6);
      --accent2: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #60a5fa);
      --text:    #e2e8f0;
      --text2:   #94a3b8;
      --border:  rgba(124,58,237,.25);
      --card:    rgba(255,255,255,.03);
      --card2:   rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      --success: #10b981;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ── SHARED ── */
    .section-label {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .75rem;
      letter-spacing: .15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: var(--accent2);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: .75rem;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .section-title span {
      background: var(--accent2);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    .section-sub {
      color: var(--text2);
      font-size: 1rem;
      max-width: 560px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .visually-hidden {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px; height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0,0,0,0);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* ══ CONTACT ══ */
    #contact {
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy3) 100%);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    #contact::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -200px; right: -200px;
      width: 500px; height: 500px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124,58,237,.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    #contact::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -200px; left: -100px;
      width: 400px; height: 400px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,.10) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .contact-wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    /* Info Panel */
    .info-panel { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }
    .info-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--card2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      transition: transform .3s ease, border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    }
    .info-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: rgba(168,85,247,.5);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(124,58,237,.15);
    }
    .info-icon {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,58,237,.2), rgba(59,130,246,.2));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .info-card h4 {
      font-size: .8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      color: var(--text2);
      margin-bottom: .2rem;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    }
    .info-card p { color: var(--text); font-size: .95rem; }
    .social-row { display: flex; gap: .5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: .35rem; }
    .social-btn {
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      background: var(--card2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--text2);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      transition: all .3s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .social-btn:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,58,237,.3), rgba(59,130,246,.3));
      border-color: var(--purple2);
      color: #fff;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124,58,237,.3);
    }

    /* Form Panel */
    .form-panel {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    .form-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .field-group { position: relative; }
    .field-group.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .field-group input,
    .field-group select,
    .field-group textarea {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.1rem 1rem .5rem;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
      font-size: .95rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
    }
    .field-group textarea { min-height: 130px; resize: vertical; }
    .field-group select { padding-top: .85rem; cursor: pointer; }
    .field-group select option { background: #1a1a2e; color: var(--text); }
    .field-group input:focus,
    .field-group select:focus,
    .field-group textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--purple2);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,58,237,.15);
    }
    .field-group label {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 1rem;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: var(--text2);
      font-size: .9rem;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: all .25s ease;
    }
    .field-group textarea ~ label { top: 1.1rem; transform: none; }
    .field-group input:focus ~ label,
    .field-group input:not(:placeholder-shown) ~ label,
    .field-group select:focus ~ label,
    .field-group textarea:focus ~ label,
    .field-group textarea:not(:placeholder-shown) ~ label {
      top: .4rem;
      transform: none;
      font-size: .7rem;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      color: var(--purple2);
    }
    .btn-submit {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .75rem;
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
      padding: .95rem 2.5rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity .3s, transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
    }
    .btn-submit:hover {
      opacity: .9;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(124,58,237,.4);
    }
    .btn-submit:active { transform: scale(.98); }
    .success-msg {
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .5rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      padding: .9rem 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(16,185,129,.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16,185,129,.3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: var(--success);
      font-size: .9rem;
      animation: fadeSlideIn .4s ease;
    }
    .success-msg.show { display: flex; }
    @keyframes fadeSlideIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* ══ FAQ ══ */
    #faq {
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy3) 0%, var(--navy2) 100%);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    #faq::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 600px; height: 600px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,.07) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .faq-inner { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .faq-inner .section-sub { max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .faq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; }
    .faq-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--card);
      transition: border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    }
    .faq-item.open {
      border-color: rgba(168,85,247,.5);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(124,58,237,.12);
    }
    .faq-question {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left;
      gap: 1rem;
      transition: color .3s;
    }
    .faq-question:hover { color: #c4b5fd; }
    .faq-icon {
      width: 28px; height: 28px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--purple2);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      transition: transform .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1), background .3s, border-color .3s;
    }
    .faq-item.open .faq-icon {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,58,237,.3), rgba(59,130,246,.3));
      border-color: var(--purple2);
    }
    .faq-answer {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
    }
    .faq-item.open .faq-answer { max-height: 300px; }
    .faq-answer-inner {
      padding: .25rem 1.5rem 1.4rem;
      color: var(--text2);
      font-size: .95rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* ══ FOOTER ══ */
    footer {
      background: var(--navy);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 5rem 2rem 2rem;
    }
    .footer-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr 1fr 1.4fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 900;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: block;
    }
    .footer-logo span {
      background: var(--accent2);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    .footer-brand p {
      color: var(--text2);
      font-size: .88rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .footer-col h5 {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .72rem;
      letter-spacing: .15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text2);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .footer-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
    .footer-col ul li a {
      color: var(--text2);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: .9rem;
      transition: color .25s, padding-left .25s;
    }
    .footer-col ul li a:hover { color: var(--blue2); padding-left: 6px; }
    .footer-col > p {
      color: var(--text2);
      font-size: .88rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .nl-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .6rem; }
    .nl-input {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: .8rem 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
      font-size: .9rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    }
    .nl-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--purple2);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,58,237,.15);
    }
    .nl-btn {
      padding: .75rem 1.25rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Exo 2', sans-serif;
      font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity .3s, transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
    }
    .nl-btn:hover {
      opacity: .9;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(124,58,237,.35);
    }
    .nl-btn.subscribed {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(16,185,129,.3);
    }
    .footer-bottom {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .footer-bottom p { color: var(--text2); font-size: .82rem; }
    .footer-bottom-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .footer-bottom-links a {
      color: var(--text2);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: .82rem;
      transition: color .25s;
    }
    .footer-bottom-links a:hover { color: var(--blue2); }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 580px) {
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .form-panel { padding: 1.5rem; }
      .faq-question { font-size: .9rem; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; }
      .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ══════════ CONTACT ══════════ -->
<section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
  <div class="contact-wrap">
    <p class="section-label">Get In Touch</p>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="contact-heading">Contact <span>Us</span></h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Have questions about EchoSee? Our team responds within 24 hours. We'd love to hear from you.</p>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <!-- Info -->
      <aside class="info-panel" aria-label="Contact information">
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">📧</div>
          <div><h4>Email</h4><p>hello@echosee.pk</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">📞</div>
          <div><h4>Phone</h4><p>+92 300 1234567</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">📍</div>
          <div><h4>Address</h4><p>EchoSee HQ, Islamabad, Pakistan</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌐</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Follow Us</h4>
            <div class="social-row">
              <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="Facebook">f</a>
              <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="Instagram">ig</a>
              <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="Twitter / X">𝕏</a>
              <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="LinkedIn">in</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <!-- Form -->
      <div class="form-panel">
        <form id="contactForm" novalidate aria-label="Send us a message">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field-group">
              <input type="text" id="fname" placeholder=" " autocomplete="given-name" required aria-required="true"/>
              <label for="fname">First Name</label>
            </div>
            <div class="field-group">
              <input type="text" id="lname" placeholder=" " autocomplete="family-name" required aria-required="true"/>
              <label for="lname">Last Name</label>
            </div>
            <div class="field-group">
              <input type="email" id="email" placeholder=" " autocomplete="email" required aria-required="true"/>
              <label for="email">Email Address</label>
            </div>
            <div class="field-group">
              <input type="tel" id="phone" placeholder=" " autocomplete="tel"/>
              <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            </div>
            <div class="field-group full">
              <select id="subject" aria-label="Subject">
                <option value="" disabled selected></option>
                <option>Pre-Order Enquiry</option>
                <option>Product Support</option>
                <option>Partnership</option>
                <option>Press / Media</option>
                <option>Other</option>
              </select>
              <label for="subject">Subject</label>
            </div>
            <div class="field-group full">
              <textarea id="message" placeholder=" " required aria-required="true"></textarea>
              <label for="message">Your Message</label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">
            <span>Send Message</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </button>
          <div class="success-msg" id="successMsg" role="alert" aria-live="polite">
            ✓ Message sent! We'll get back to you within 24 hours.
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════ FAQ ══════════ -->
<section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <p class="section-label">Common Questions</p>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Everything you need to know about EchoSee Smart Glasses.</p>

    <div class="faq-list" role="list">

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq1">
          What is EchoSee and how does it work?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq1" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">EchoSee Smart Glasses use an AI-powered chip to capture speech through a noise-cancelling microphone, convert it to text in real time, and project subtitles directly onto the AR lens — so you can read conversations as they happen.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq2">
          Do EchoSee glasses work offline?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq2" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes! Our onboard AI processor handles speech-to-text locally, meaning core functionality works without any internet connection. Premium language translation features require connectivity.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq3">
          What languages are supported?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq3" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">The basic plan includes Urdu and English. The Premium Plan unlocks 20+ languages with real-time translation, including Arabic, Hindi, French, Spanish, and more — with regular AI updates adding new languages.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq4">
          How long does the battery last?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq4" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">EchoSee provides 10–12 hours of continuous use on a single charge — enough for a full working day. The glasses charge via magnetic USB-C in approximately 1.5 hours.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq5">
          Can I adjust the subtitle font size?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq5" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Absolutely. The EchoSee companion app lets you customize font size, color, contrast, and subtitle position directly on the AR lens to suit your individual needs.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6">
          What warranty and after-sales support do you offer?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq6" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Every pair comes with a 1-year manufacturer warranty covering hardware defects. We also provide regular OTA software updates and a dedicated support team. Accessories are available separately from our shop.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq7">
          How do I pre-order EchoSee?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq7" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Head to our Shop / Pre-Order page, fill in your details and choose your plan. Pre-orders are currently priced at PKR 35,000–40,000. A confirmation email will be sent upon successful order.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq8">
          What is the emoji-based emotion display feature?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq8" role="region">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Our AI analyses the tone of speech and overlays contextual emojis alongside your subtitles — letting you pick up on emotions like excitement, sadness, or sarcasm that are easy to miss with text alone.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

